# Backend (.NET)

- Stack: .NET 9; structure — Gateway, services (Identity, Dog) with Domain/Application/Infrastructure/WebApi or Api layers.
- Image build: from `scripts/` — `./build_backend.sh`.
- Full backend redeploy (stop stacks → build backend → start local): from `scripts/` — `./redeploy_backend_local.sh`.
